{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在音乐细节的颗粒度和乐句进行中的即时感受提示上明显不如Y，尤其少了那些随音乐逐步出现的细微变化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分区让叙事和感受各有位置，短时间内更容易扫读；完整的因果句也更容易让观众理解人物为什么收住、为什么担心，以及情绪如何一步步变化。Y的【】高亮有利于迅速抓住每段核心，按乐句出现的感受也更细腻、更贴近音乐，但静态感受词仍然偏多，容易让注意力从人物主线转移到感受清单上。整体而言，X更容易让普通观众在听音乐的同时跟住完整故事，Y则在音乐细节的呈现上更有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6918e0aa-0e3f-44cf-9f76-77778acb1139", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T182017176326Z", "elapsed_seconds": 137.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:22:34.584109+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5e354dacdde86c9a7b9b296367765a1c45d168f6de1de218b1f03fdbf58de64b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3